  "conclusions": [
    "In QA Docker29.1.3 containerd storage, removing four exact shared compressed blobs reduced this Flask archive from 57046835 to11121120 bytes, while the exact target image and dependency execution passed when base content was present.",
    "Native Cloud Shell Docker29.8.1 uses containerd storage and had the matching FastAPI rootfs cached. No thin archive was imported into user compute, so native thin-load support is not established.",
    "With an empty separate physical containerd store, Docker load exited0 and image inspect returned the expected ID although required blobs were absent; execution failed125 before application code ran.",
